        className: "language-mermaid",
        children: "flowchart TB\n    subgraph Deploy[Deploy Model]\n        A[Production Deployment]\n    end\n    subgraph Monitor[Monitoring Loop]\n        B[Accuracy Check]\n        C[Drift Detection]\n        D[Latency Check]\n        E[Traffic Monitoring]\n    end\n    subgraph Decide[Decision]\n        F{All Healthy?}\n        G[Log and Continue]\n        H[Trigger Alert]\n        I[Request Retraining]\n    end\n    subgraph Retrain[Retraining Pipeline]\n        J[Collect New Data]\n        K[Label / Validate]\n        L[Fine-tune Model]\n        M[Evaluate]\n    end\n    A --> B --> C --> D --> E --> F\n    F -->|Yes| G\n    F -->|No| H --> I --> J --> K --> L --> M --> A\n    G --> B\n"
